@test_HostAddress = http://localhost:5241

### 1. Test PostgreSQL connection
GET {{test_HostAddress}}/api/registros/test-db
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get paginated list of foods consumed (Page 1, 10 items)
GET {{test_HostAddress}}/api/registros?fecha=2026-10-15&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get total calculated nutrients consumed on a date
GET {{test_HostAddress}}/api/registros/nutrientes?fecha=2026-10-15
Accept: application/json

### 4. [PLACEHOLDER] Get calculated nutrients for date range
GET {{test_HostAddress}}/api/registros/nutrientes/rango?fechaInicio=2026-10-01&fechaFin=2026-10-15
Accept: application/json

### 5. Create a new food record (POST)
POST {{test_HostAddress}}/api/registros
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alimentoId": 1,
  "fecha": "2026-10-18",
  "hora": "12:30:00",
  "cantidadGramos": 150.0
}

### 6. Update an existing food record (PUT)
# Replace '1' with an existing registro_alimentario_id
PUT {{test_HostAddress}}/api/registros/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alimentoId": 1,
  "fecha": "2026-10-18",
  "hora": "13:00:00",
  "cantidadGramos": 200.0
}

### 7. Delete a food record (DELETE)
# Replace '1' with the registro_alimentario_id to delete
DELETE {{test_HostAddress}}/api/registros/1
Accept: application/json
